hallenge - VR Fun Game", "keywords": ["BuzzWire", "ArcadeGame", "FunGame", "ElectricRode", "WireGame"], "long_description": "Can you keep a steady hand under pressure?\nStep into the world of Buzz Wire Challenge VR, the ultimate test of precision, focus, and hand-eye coordination. Navigate your loop through a variety of challenging wire tracks while avoiding contact with the wire. Every touch triggers the buzzer and adds penalties to your score.\nWhether you're looking for a fun party game, a family-friendly challenge, or a way to sharpen your reflexes, Buzz Wire Challenge VR delivers an engaging experience for players of all ages.\nFeatures:\n\u2022 Realistic VR hand tracking and controls\n\u2022 Multiple wire courses with increasing difficulty\n\u2022 Time-based challenges and score tracking\n\u2022 Fun sound and visual effects for every mistake\n\u2022 Competitive gameplay to beat your personal best\n\u2022 Suitable for casual players and precision masters alike\nStay focused, keep your hands steady, and see if you have what it takes to become the ultimate Buzz Wire Champion!", "short_description": "Test your precision and steady hands in Buzz Wire Challenge VR! Guide the loop through challenging wire courses without touching the wire and setting off the buzzer."}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-games-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor"